It appeared a far more sinister motive than robbery was at play this time. The intimacy of the crime, from the choice of murder weapon to the victim's wounds being centred around the head, indicated something more personal prompted the attack. Years earlier, Peter had been working as an appellate judge when he received a death threat from a man who was given an unfavourable ruling. Peter took the threat seriously and obtained a handgun for protection. He kept it by his bedside table, but as time passed and no action was taken against him, his worries dissipated.
这一次似乎存在着比抢劫更为阴险的动机。案件的私密性，从凶的选择到受害者伤口集中在头部，都表明促成此次袭击的是某种更加私人的原因。多年前，彼得曾担任上诉法官，当时他收到了一名因判决不利而心生不满的男子发出的死亡威胁。彼得对该威胁高度重视，并获得了一把手枪用于自卫。他把它放在床头柜旁，但随着时间流逝，对方并未采取进一步行动，他的担忧也随之消散。

18
00:12:20.000 --> 00:13:04.000
Eventually, Peter stored the gun away in a closet. Following the murders, the man who had made the death threat was tracked down but cleared from the investigation after providing a solid alibi. Peter also had unlikely ties to the criminal underworld in that his great uncle, Frank Porco, was a known New York mobster. 30 years prior, Frank had arrived at Peter and Joan's wedding dripping in gold jewellery, flaunting large amounts of cash, and had a revolver strapped to his leg. There were rumours that Frank had snitched on his fellow mobsters, leading to the belief
最终，彼得把枪收进了衣柜里。谋杀案发生后，发出死亡威胁的那名男子被追踪到，但由于提供了不在场证明而洗脱了嫌疑。彼得与犯罪黑社会也有着不太可能的联系，他的曾叔父弗兰克·波科是纽约知名的黑手党成员。30年前，弗兰克曾穿着一身挂满黄金首饰、炫耀着大量现金的行头出现在彼得和琼的婚礼上，他的腿上还绑着一把左轮手枪。有传言称，弗兰克曾向其他黑手党同伙告密，这让人觉得

